   "title": "How an agent's key reaches its home's Factory key list",
   "detail": "A home asks for a commit signed with a key published in the Factory's team/keys.json. The Factory's own rule says that file waits for Dinis's merge; helm.d relays that each agent publishes its own by a signed commit of its own; CLAUDE.md's no-agent-blocked rule lists 'making and publishing your own key by your own signed commit' as an own-area step.",
